    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "This jagged blade served as a grim instrument of the Dark Lord's will within the halls of Mordor. To wield it is to invite a crushing sense of inevitable ruin upon every foe it strikes. Its edge bites deep, delivering a finality that transcends simple steel."
